Every buprenorphine is a partial-agonist-opioid.
Every buprenorphine can treat a pain and can treat an opioid-use-disorder.
Every buprenorphine possibly can be helpful.
Every buprenorphine causes a less-than-other-opioid-respiratory-depression.
Every buprenorphine carries a less-than-other-opioid-overdose-risk.
